      "aspect": "Flexible project views and customization",
      "claim": "The ability to switch between list, calendar, timeline, and Kanban views allows for versatile management of social media content schedules, campaign tracking, and overall task progression. Custom fields are highly valuable for categorizing posts by client, platform, or content type.",
