      "aspect": "Streamlined personal workload management and automation",
      "claim": "Features like 'My Tasks' and 'Inbox' centralize personal assignments and updates, crucial for a self-employed individual juggling multiple clients. Automation rules and templates further help standardize repetitive social media workflows across different clients, saving time and ensuring consistency.",
